<title>AUSTRALIA: Leighton shares gain further on profit,div.</title>
<headline>Leighton shares gain further on profit,div.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in construction group Leighton Holdings Ltd surged further on Friday as the market digested the record profit and special dividend the company announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>At 10.30 a.m. (0030 GMT), Leighton shares were 23 cents or 3.76 percent higher at A$6.35 in light volume.</p>
